## ⚙️ Setup Instructions

### 📥 Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ParshantRaja/student-performance-analysis.git
cd student-performance-analysis
```

### 📦 Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install streamlit pandas
```

### ▶️ Run Project

```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

### 🌐 Open Application

```
http://localhost:8501
```

