## 🚀 Application Usage

1. Run the Streamlit application
2. Open **Data Overview & Merged Data**
3. Explore dataset insights and statistics
4. Navigate to **Student Performance Prediction**
5. Enter student details
6. Click **Predict**
7. View predicted final grade and Pass/Fail result

